        "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-0000000000ff": {
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- Appmixer account: auth+hubspot@appmixer.com (service appmixer:hubspot), HubSpot portal 148964607 (developer test account).\n- The HubSpot app's webhook target URL must point at this Appmixer instance (own app, appId + apiKey in the service config) — the trigger subscribes to `e2e_watched_note` itself at flow start.\n- **Custom contact property `e2e_watched_note` must exist** (string/text, group contactinformation). Create it once: HubSpot MakeApiCall `POST /crm/v3/properties/contacts` `{\"name\":\"e2e_watched_note\",\"label\":\"E2E Watched Note\",\"type\":\"string\",\"fieldType\":\"text\",\"groupName\":\"contactinformation\"}`.\n- The Waits must stay: 1m for the subscription to propagate, 1m between create and update, 1m before the cleanup delete (the triggers read the contact ~5 s after the event).\n- Lane 1 = Watched Properties (must ignore the creation-time email/name events); lane 2 = no filter (both must receive the same change).",
